"""
Login + Dashboard + Excel Test-Result Tools
============================================
A Tkinter desktop app that:
  1. Shows a Login page (username/password).
  2. After successful login, opens a Dashboard with two options:

     Option 1 - "Excel/CSV Viewer"
         - Upload an Excel (.xlsx/.xls/.xlsm) or CSV file
         - View its contents in a scrollable table that LOOKS like Excel
         - Pick the column that holds the test status
         - See automatic counts of Pass / Fail / Not Testable / Blocked

     Option 2 - "SyRs Pass/Fail"
         - Upload an Excel or CSV file
         - Pick the "Verifies" column (requirement / SyRs id each row maps to)
         - Pick the "Result" column (Pass/Fail/Not Testable/Blocked)
         - Not Testable + Blocked are combined into a single "Blocked" bucket
         - Duplicate "Verifies" ids (the same requirement covered by more
           than one test row) are de-duplicated to ONE final verdict per id,
           decided individually (not by comparing every row to every other
           row) using this priority: Blocked > Fail > Pass
         - Duplicate/conflicting rows are conditionally formatted (highlighted)
           in the table so you can see at a glance where a requirement was
           tested more than once
         - Final Pass / Fail / Blocked counts + an aligned table of Verifies
           ids in each bucket, each with its raw row count, are shown

Requirements:
    pip install pandas openpyxl

Run:
    python test.py

Default login credentials (change them below):
    Username: admin
    Password: admin123
"""

